{"Beam": 10.8, "City": "", "Open": false, "Year": 2018, "tags": [], "MLSID": 450528, "Length": 51, "EventID": 0, "IsModel": false, "LOAFeet": 167.32, "details": {"VD": {"VesselID": 447395, "CultureID": 1, "DataSource": 1, "VesselName": "PROMISE.", "CultureName": "English", "CultureShortName": "EN", "Loading_ShortDescription": false, "Loading_MyWebSiteDescription": false, "VesselDescriptionBrokerTeaser": "", "Loading_YatcoDotComDescription": false, "VesselDescriptionInternalTeaser": "", "VesselDescriptionShortDescription": "<p>Delivered in 2018 by Feadship and fresh from a major refit in 2025, 51m MY Promise. combines proven Northern European pedigree with forward-thinking design and technical innovation. She is the first Feadship to achieve Ice Class 1E certification and a Lloyd&rsquo;s Polar Ship Certificate, allowing safe navigation in open polar waters down to &ndash;10&deg;C. Built to full commercial compliance yet privately registered, she offers both operational flexibility and robust long-term value.</p><p>Her design prioritises guest comfort and accessibility. A guest elevator and separate food lift serve all decks, while a unique step-free layout ensures smooth, flush transitions between interior and exterior spaces. Expansive outdoor living is enhanced by a side balcony, as well as a helideck-capable bridge deck aft with structural approval for EC135 helicopter operations.</p><p>Guest accommodations include two master suites with ensuite Onsen baths and steam showers, plus four additional cabins, offering versatile space for up to 10 guests. Bulletproof glazing in the Owner&rsquo;s Suite further underlines her robust build quality.</p><p>Leisure and functionality are equally considered: a heated freshwater pool with contraflow swim system, advanced AV/IT upgrades completed in 2025, and a wide selection of tenders and toys. Behind the scenes, Tier III compliance, extensive technical servicing, and a &euro;6m refit at Feadship Makkum ensure MY Promise. is turnkey and maintained to the highest standard.</p><p>With her rare ice classification, accessibility features, and impeccable refit, MY Promise. represents an exceptional opportunity to acquire a world-class Feadship designed for both exploration and refined guest living.</p><ul class="depth2"><li><h3>KEY FEATURES</h3><ul class="depth3"><li class="bullet">First Feadship with Ice Class 1E &amp; LR Polar Ship Certificate</li><li class="bullet">2025 Feadship refit (&euro;6m), paint, systems &amp; interior upgrades</li><li class="bullet">Tier III compliant for Emission Control Areas</li><li class="bullet">Privately registered, built to full commercial compliance</li><li class="bullet">10 guests in 6 cabins, including 2 master suites</li><li class="bullet">Guest elevator &amp; separate food lift serving multiple decks</li><li class="bullet">Step-free, flush transition design from stern to elevator</li><li class="bullet">Owner&rsquo;s Suite balcony</li><li class="bullet">Bridge deck aft structurally approved for EC135 heliops (3t)</li><li class="bullet">Master ensuites with Onsen baths &amp; steam showers</li><li class="bullet">Bulletproof BR4 glazing to Owner&rsquo;s Suite portlights</li><li class="bullet">Heated freshwater pool with contraflow swim system</li><li class="bullet">Comprehensive AV/IT upgrades including 5G &amp; Starlink</li><li class="bullet">Wide range of tenders, toys &amp; dive equipment</li><li class="bullet">Extensive onboard spares &amp; IDEA planned maintenance system</li></ul></li></ul>", "VesselDescriptionShowingInstructions": "", "VesselDescriptionShortDescriptionNoStyles": "<p> Delivered in 2018 by Feadship and fresh from a major refit in 2025, 51m MY Promise. combines proven Northern European pedigree with forward-thinking design and technical innovation. She is the first Feadship to achieve Ice Class 1E certification and a Lloyd&rsquo;s Polar Ship Certificate, allowing safe navigation in open polar waters down to &ndash;10&deg;C. Built to full 