ader">GALLEY</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>2 x MKN steam ovens</li><li>6 x Zone induction hobs</li><li>1 x Induction wok</li><li>1 x Deep-fat fryer</li><li>1 x Panasonic combi oven</li><li>1 x Walk-in fridge</li><li>1 x Walk-in freezer</li><li>1 x Fridge in island</li><li>2 x Miele Professional dishwashers</li><li>1 x Hoshizaki ice machine</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">DECK</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>1 x Miele Fridge</li><li>1 x U-Line Wine Cooler</li><li>1 x Hoshizaki Icemaker</li><li>1 x Frigonautica fridge on aft deck</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">CREW</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>1 x Miele Fridge</li><li>1 x Miele Professional dishwasher</li><li>1 x Miele combi microwave</li><li>2 x Garbage fridges</li><li>1 x Marinaut vacuum garbage machine</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">LAUNDRY</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>3 x Miele Professional dryer</li><li>3 x Miele Professional washing machine</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></li><li id="safety-and-security-equipment"><h1><span style="font-size:medium;">SAFETY &amp; SECURITY EQUIPMENT</span></h1><table class="depth2 k-table"><tbody><tr><th class="header">SAFETY</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>1 x SOPEP kit</li><li>1 x Medaire global kit with Neil Roberson and Wolf stretchers</li><li>2 x Zoll AED3 defibrillators</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">SECURITY</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>1 x AMCS exterior door locking system</li><li>16 x CCTV cameras</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">FIRE FIGHTING</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>Hi-Fog throughout vessel accommodations areas</li><li>4 x SCBA set PAS Lite-A</li><li>8 x Composite SCBA cylinders</li><li>2 x Manual release F/F for tenders garage</li><li>1 x Manual release F/F for emergency generator room</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></li><li id="tenders-and-watersports-equipment"><h1><span style="font-size:medium;">TENDERS &amp; WATERSPORTS EQUIPMENT</span></h1><table class="depth2 k-table"><tbody><tr><th class="header">TENDERS</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>1 x 8.10m Pascoe Limousine 10-person, 2 x Yanmar 4BY3 180Z</li><li>1 x 6.80m Pascoe Utility, 12-person, 1 x Yanmar 6BY 260hp</li><li>1 x 4.20m Narwhal SV 420 Rescue, 6-person, 1 x Yamaha F25G outboard</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">WATERSPORTS</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>2 x Yamaha WaveRunner VX Cruiser</li><li>2 x SeaBob F5 Cayago</li><li>1 x Jobe Sonar</li><li>1 x Jobe Chaser</li><li>2 x Jobe SUP&rsquo;s</li><li>4 x Tomahawk inflatable kayak&rsquo;s</li><li>1 x Wakeboard</li><li>1 x Wake surf board</li><li>1 x Lagoon pool, inflatable</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">DIVING</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>1 x Bauer Junior 2 Compressor</li><li>10 x 12Ltr steel dive cylinders</li><li>Assorted BCD&rsquo;s, regulators, fins, wetsuits</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></li><li id="refit-and-maintenance-notes"><h1><span style="font-size:medium;">REFIT &amp; MAINTENANCE NOTES</span></h1><ul class="depth2"><li><h3>2025:</h3><ul class="depth3"><li class="bullet">Full repaint of hull and superstructure</li><li class="bullet">Main engines and generators fully serviced with control upgrades</li><li class="bullet">Complete HVAC overhaul with new condensers, duct cleaning, and air purification system</li><li class="bullet">Propulsion system overhauled: shafts, thrust bearings, shaft brakes, and new oil filtration</li><li class="bullet">Bridge navigation upgrades: new nav lights, FLIR camera, MF/HF GMDSS</li><li class="bullet">Complete galley remodel with new appliances, stone tops, and flooring</li><li class="bullet">Upgraded AV &amp; IT: latest smart TVs, audio, servers, expanded media storage, and 5G connectivity</li><li class="bullet">Swim Platform &amp; Guest Balcony mechanisms overhauled</li><li class="bullet">Al tanks cleaned and touched-up where necessary</li><li class="bullet">Exterior upgrades: new sun awnings, umbrella, canvas enclosures, reupholstered seating, new bar and teak tops</li><li class="bullet">Pool, cranes, doors, windlasses, capstans, and steering systems serviced</li><li class="bullet">Interior improvements: new carpets, select reupholstery, finish repairs</li><li class="bullet">Cathelco upgrade for sea water system</li><li class="bullet">Air conditioning upgrade to aft technical space</li></ul></li></ul></li><li id="comments"><h1><span style="font-size:medium;">COMMENTS</span></h1><p>Delivered in 2018 by Feadship and fresh from a major refit in 2025, 51m MY Promise. combines proven Northern European pedigree with forward-thinking design and technical innovation. She is the first Feadship to achieve Ice Class 1E certification and a Lloyd&rsquo;s Polar Ship Certificate, allowing safe navigation in open polar waters down to &ndash;10&deg;C. Built to full commercial compliance yet privately registered, she offers both operational flexibility and robust long-term value.</p><p>Her design prioritises guest comfort and accessibility. A guest elevator and separate food lift serve all decks, while a unique step-free layout ensures smooth, flush transitions between interior and exterior spaces. Expansive outdoor living is enhanced by a side balcony, as well as a helideck-capable bridge deck aft with structural approval for EC135 helicopter operations.</p><p>Guest accommodations include two master suites with ensuite Onsen baths and steam showers, plus four additional cabins, offering versatile space for up to 10 guests. Bulletproof glazing in the Owner&rsquo;s Suite further underlines her robust build quality.</p><p>Leisure and functionality are equally considered: a heated freshwater pool with contraflow swim system, advanced AV/IT upgrades completed in 2025, and a wide selection of tenders and toys. Behind the scenes, Tier III compliance, extensive technical servicing, and a &euro;6m refit at Feadship Makkum ensure MY Promise. is turnkey and maintained to the highest standard.</p><p>With her rare ice classification, accessibility features, and impeccable refit, MY Promise. represents an exceptional opportunity to acquire a world-class Feadship designed for both exploration and refined guest living.</p><ul class="depth2"><li><h3><span style="font-size:x-small;">KEY FEATURES</span></h3><ul class="depth3"><li class="bullet">First Feadship with Ice Class 1E &amp; LR Polar Ship Certificate</li><li class="bullet">2025 Feadship refit (&euro;6m), paint, systems &amp; interior upgrades</li><li class="bullet">Tier III compliant for Emission Control Areas</li><li class="bullet">Privately registered, built to full commercial compliance</li><li class="bullet">10 guests in 6 cabins, including 2 master suites</li><li class="bullet">Guest elevator &amp; separate food lift serving multiple decks</li><li class="bullet">Step-free, flush transition design from stern to elevator</li><li class="bullet">Owner&rsquo;s Suite balcony</li><li class="bullet">Bridge deck aft structurally approved for EC135 heliops (3t)</li><li class="bullet">Master ensuites with Onsen baths &amp; steam showers</li><li class="bullet">Bulletproof BR4 glazing to Owner&rsquo;s Suite portlights</li><li class="bullet">Heated freshwater pool with contraflow swim system</li><li class="bullet">Comprehensive AV/IT upgrades including 5G &amp; Starlink</li><li class="bullet">Wide range of tenders, toys &amp; dive equipment</li><li class="bullet">Extensive onboard spares &amp; IDEA planned maintenance system</li></ul></li></ul></li></ol></div>", "PageBreakBefore": false, "DescriptionConfirmation": true}], "BasicInfo": {"City": "", "Flag": "Cayman Islands", "State": "", "Region": "Europe", "Sleeps": 0, "Builder": "FEADSHIP", "Cockpit": false, "Concept": false, "Country": "Monaco", "Helipad": true, "StateID": 0, "isModel": false, "BoatName": "PROMISE.", "BrokerID": 2667, "Cruising": true, "Currency": "EUR", "Elevator": true, "OfficeID": 27, "RegionID": 7, "VesselID": 447395, "BuilderID": 865, "CompanyID": 27, "CountryID": 145, "FlyBridge": false, "IMONumber": "9805594", "ModelYe