allons</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">GREY WATER</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>10,420 litres / 2,753 US gallons</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">BLACK WATER</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>6,700 litres / 1,770 US gallons</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">BILGE WATER</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>2,750 litres / 726 US gallons</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">POOL WATER</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>11,580 litres / 3,059 US gallons</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></li><li id="accommodation"><h1><span style="font-size:medium;">ACCOMMODATION</span></h1><table class="depth2 k-table"><tbody><tr><th class="header">MASTER SUITES</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>2 x Double cabins with en suites</li><li>2 x Onsen bath and steam showers</li><li>BR4 Bullet proof glass portlights</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">GUEST CABINS</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>2 x Double cabins with en suites</li><li>2 x Single cabins with en suites</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">STAFF CABINS</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>2 x Bunk cabins with en suites</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">OBSERVATION DECK</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>Main saloon with dining area aft</li><li>Cosy lounge forward</li><li>Day head with shower</li><li>Pantry</li><li>Guest Staircase and elevator</li><li>Crew Staircase and food lift</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">LOWER DECK</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>Galley with Pantry area, cold &amp; freezer stores</li><li>6 x Crew bunk cabins with en suites</li><li>Crew Mess</li><li>Crew Laundry &amp; AV Room</li><li>Crew Staircase and food lift</li><li>Engine Control Room</li></ul></td></tr><tr><th class="header">BRIDGE</th><td><ul class="depth3"><li>Wheelhouse</li><li>Crew Office</li><li>Captain&rsquo;s cabin &amp; ensuite</li><li>Day head</li><li>Multipurpose lounge</li><li>Guest Staircase and elevator</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></li><li id="mechanical-equipment"><h1><span style="font-size:mediu