{"Beam": 10.8, "City": "", "Open": false, "Year": 2018, "tags": [], "MLSID": 450528, "Length": 51, "EventID": 0, "IsModel": false, "LOAFeet": 167.32, "details": {"VD": {"VesselID": 447395, "CultureID": 1, "DataSource": 1, "VesselName": "PROMISE.", "CultureName": "English", "CultureShortName": "EN", "Loading_ShortDescription": false, "Loading_MyWebSiteDescription": false, "VesselDescriptionBrokerTeaser": "", "Loading_YatcoDotComDescription": false, "VesselDescriptionInternalTeaser": "", "VesselDescriptionShortDescription": "<p>Delivered in 2018 by Feadship and fresh from a major refit in 2025, 51m MY Promise. combines proven Northern European pedigree with forward-thinking design and technical innovation. She is the first Feadship to achieve Ice Class 1E certification and a Lloyd&rsquo;s Polar Ship Certificate, allowing safe navigation in open polar waters down to &ndash;10&deg;C. Built to full commercial compliance yet privately registered, she offers both operational flexibility and robust long-term value.</p><p>Her design prioritises guest comfort and accessibility. A guest elevator and separate food lift serve all decks, while a unique step-free layout ensures smooth, flush transitions between interior and exterior spaces. Expansive outdoor living is enhanced by a side balcony, as well as a helideck-capable bridge deck aft with structural approval for EC135 helicopter operations.</p><p>Guest accommodations include two master suites with ensuite Onsen baths and steam showers, plus four additional cabins, offering versatile space for up to 10 guests. Bulletproof glazing in the Owner&rsquo;s Suite further underlines her robust build quality.</p><p>Leisure and functionality are equally considered: a heated freshwater pool with contraflow swim system, advanced AV/IT upgrades completed in 2025, and a wide selection of tenders and toys. Behind the scenes, Tier III compliance, extensive technical servicing, and a &euro;6m refit at Feadship Makkum ensure MY Promise. is tu